<title>UK: Warburg placing Compass shares - traders.</title>
<headline>Warburg placing Compass shares - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Compass Group fell 20p to 598p on Thursday amid talk of a placing of shares by SBC Warburg, traders said.</p>
<p>Dealers said Warburg were placing 12 million shares at 593p.</p>
<p>No-one at Warburg was immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
</text>
